<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS6" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ RoboChemist: Long-Horizon and Safety-Compliant Robotic Chemical Experimentation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.6 </span>Inner Loop Enhancement: Implementation and Evaluation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS7" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ RoboChemist: Long-Horizon and Safety-Compliant Robotic Chemical Experimentation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.7 </span>Details of Used VLA Architecture</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS8" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ RoboChemist: Long-Horizon and Safety-Compliant Robotic Chemical Experimentation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.8 </span>Error Breakdown</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS9" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ RoboChemist: Long-Horizon and Safety-Compliant Robotic Chemical Experimentation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.9 </span>Generalization on environment, and embodiment</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
