<p id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Heats at the wrong location but returns: 0.5</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.I1.i4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Heats at the correct location but does not return: 0.75</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.I1.i5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.I1.i2.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Heats at the correct location and returns: 1</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Inserting Platinum Wire into Solution:</span></p>
<ul id="A1.I1.i3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
