<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Pouring Liquid:</span></p>
<ul id="A1.I1.i4.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
