<p id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Grasped but spills completely: 0.25</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Grasped but spills slightly: 0.75</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.I1.i4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
