<p id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Successfully grasps and pours liquid with control: 1</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stirring Solution with a Glass Rod:</span></p>
<ul id="A1.I1.i5.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i5.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
